==German==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|de|Alptraum}} {{q|standard spelling until 1996; still correct, but disfavoured and becoming less common}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|Alb|Traum|lang=de}}, because nightmares were formerly thought to be caused by an elf sitting on one's chest while one slept.

